 an ABM Attack Plan</span></div></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-white transition-all hover:border-ssl-gold/40 hover:bg-ssl-gold/5 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#c5a059] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-[#01081b] focus-visible:outline-none md:hidden\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ssl-mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><div class=\"relative h-5 w-5\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-0.5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-all duration-300 -translate-y-[6px]\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-0.5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-0.5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 bg-current transition-all duration-300 translate-y-[4px]\"></span></div></button></div></div></div><div id=\"ssl-mobile-menu\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-40 flex h-screen w-screen flex-col bg-[#01081b]/95 backdrop-blur-2xl backdrop-saturate-150 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out md:hidden translate-x-full opacity-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><nav class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-2\"><a href=\"/services\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><span>Services</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-6 w-6 opacity-30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"/insights\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.03] py-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-300 transition-colors hover:text-ssl-gold\" style=\"transition-delay:50ms\"><span>Insights</span><svg viewBox=\